    "_resource_blocks_comment": "A tree spends one state of a locked leaf on stage 0 and one state of a mineable leaf on stage 1, so a pair of leaf ids covers four biomes, then takes a glass id for each of stages 2 and 3. A locked id is never a mineable stage anywhere, because a tool rule takes a block tag and a tag cannot see state. model_suffixes lets a stage draw more than one random variant per name.",

